://vuejs.org/","size":40047,"stargazers_count":53172,"watchers_count":53172,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":9062,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":983,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":9062,"open_issues":983,"watchers":53172,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### Vue version\n\n3.5.8\n\n### Link to minimal reproduction\n\nhttps://play.vuejs.org/#\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nclick `hide` , `mutate`, `show` in sequence, you will see the computed result is wrong!\r\n\r\n```\r\nconst flagChar = computed(() => (props.flag ? '1' : '0'));\r\n```\r\n![bug](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/222a82e9-05c4-4d70-9aff-9fe115344c69)\r\n\n\n### What is expected?\n\ncomputed result is 1 if flag is `true`\n\n### What is actually happening?\n\nsome optimizations in vue related to 'v-if' block the `computed` hooks to take place.\n\n### System Info\n\n```shell\nSystem:\r\n    OS: Windows 11 10.0.22631\r\n    CPU: (32) x64 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900HX\r\n    Memory: 12.95 GB / 31.75 GB\r\n  Binaries:\r\n    Node: 20.12.2 - D:\\nodejs\\node.EXE\r\n    Yarn: 1.22.19 - ~\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\yarn.CMD\r\n    npm: 10.8.1 - D:\\nodejs\\npm.CMD\r\n    pnpm: 9.6.0 - ~\\AppData\\Local\\pnpm\\pnpm.CMD\r\n  Browsers:\r\n    Edge: Chromium (127.0.2651.74)\r\n    Internet Explorer: 11.0.22621.3527\r\n  npmPackages:\r\n    vue: ^3.4.29 => 3.5.8\n```\n\n\n### Any additional comments?\n\nWhen you switch the positions of `flag` and `flagChar`, the bug will disappear. ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/12028/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/12028/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":14412611541,"node_id":"CE_lADOCCum186XuUBezwAAAANbDv_V","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/events/14412611541","actor":{"login":"yyx990803","id":499550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTU1MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/499550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803","html_url":"https://github.com/yyx990803","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"closed","commit_id":"6001e5c81a05c894586f9287fbd991677bdd0455","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/commits/6001e5c81a05c894586f9287fbd991677bdd0455","created_at":"2024-09-26T08:58:48Z","state_reason":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":14412644299,"node_id":"REFE_lADOCCum186XuUBezwAAAANbD3_L","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/events/14412644299","actor":{"login":"jh-leong","id":52022476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDIyNDc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520224